{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.WenzlMarkovTraceInstance"],"declarations":26,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.wenzl_borromean_three_sub_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.wenzl_borromean_three_sub_two","kind":"theorem","line":224,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L224-L248","doc":"**The level-3 minus level-2 Borromean trace** (`docs/audits/2026-10-10-level3-su3-channel-test.md`\n§5.2), over any field with `q` not a root of unity:\n\n`tr⁽³⁾(β_Bor) − tr⁽²⁾(β_Bor) = −(q−1)⁴ (q+1)⁴ Φ₁₀ Φ₅ / (q² (q²+1)² Φ₆² Φ₃²)`,\n\n`Φ₅ = q⁴+q³+q²+q+1`, `Φ₁₀ = q⁴−q³+q²−q+1`.  A statement about `β_Bor` only. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.wenzl_borromean_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.wenzl_borromean_three","kind":"theorem","line":208,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L208-L222","doc":"**Level 3**: `tr⁽³⁾(β_Bor) = −(q¹⁶ − 2q¹⁴ − q¹² − 5q⁸ − q⁴ − 2q² + 1) / (q⁴ Φ₆² Φ₃²)`,\n`Φ₃ = q² + q + 1`, `Φ₆ = q² − q + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.wenzl_borromean_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.wenzl_borromean_two","kind":"theorem","line":197,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L197-L206","doc":"**Level 2** (convention D): `tr⁽²⁾(β_Bor) = −(q¹² − 3q¹⁰ + 2q⁸ − 4q⁶ + 2q⁴ − 3q² + 1) /\n(q⁴ (q² + 1)²)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.q421_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.q421_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":192,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L192-L195","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.levelBracket_three_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.levelBracket_three_sq","kind":"theorem","line":189,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L189-L190","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.levelBracket_two_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.levelBracket_two_sq","kind":"theorem","line":186,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L186-L187","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.q21_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.q21_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":181,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L181-L184","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.trLevel_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.trLevel_eq","kind":"theorem","line":173,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L173-L179","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.trLevel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.trLevel","kind":"def","line":168,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L168-L171","doc":"The level-`r` Wenzl trace of `β_Bor`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.tr_borromean","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.tr_borromean","kind":"theorem","line":153,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L153-L158","doc":"**The trace of the Borromean braid under any Markov trace family**, as a polynomial in the\nMarkov parameter `z`, `h = q − qi`:  `tr(β_Bor) = 1 − h⁴ − h⁵ z + h⁴ z²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.tr_nf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.tr_nf","kind":"theorem","line":146,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L146-L151","doc":"The trace of a normal-form element whose `σ₁σ₂σ₁` coefficient vanishes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.tr2_s1s0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.tr2_s1s0","kind":"theorem","line":142,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L142-L144","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.tr2_s0s1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.tr2_s0s1","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L134-L140","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.tr2_s1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.tr2_s1","kind":"theorem","line":129,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L129-L132","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.tr2_s0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.tr2_s0","kind":"theorem","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L123-L127","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.tr2_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.tr2_one","kind":"theorem","line":121,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L121-L121","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.borromean_eq_nf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.borromean_eq_nf","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L102-L113","doc":"**Normal form of the Borromean braid.**  Over any commutative ring with `q · qi = 1`, writing\n`h = q − qi`:\n`β_Bor = (1 − h⁴) − (h⁵ + h³) σ₁ + h³ σ₂ + (h⁴ + h²) σ₁σ₂ − h² σ₂σ₁ + 0 · σ₁σ₂σ₁`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.nf_mul_s1inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.nf_mul_s1inv","kind":"theorem","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L95-L100","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.nf_mul_s1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.nf_mul_s1","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L81-L93","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.nf_mul_s0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.nf_mul_s0","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L71-L79","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.braid01","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.braid01","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L68-L69","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.sq1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.sq1","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L65-L66","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.sq0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.sq0","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L62-L63","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.nf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.nf","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L56-L58","doc":"An element of `H₃` written in the basis `1, σ₁, σ₂, σ₁σ₂, σ₂σ₁, σ₁σ₂σ₁`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.betaBor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.betaBor","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L52-L54","doc":"**The Borromean braid** `β_Bor = (σ₁ σ₂⁻¹)³` in `H₃(q)` (generators indexed `0, 1`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.s1inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.BorromeanLevelTrace.s1inv","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/BorromeanLevelTrace.lean#L49-L50","doc":"`σ₂⁻¹ = σ₂ − (q − qi)` in `H₃`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}